# assets/recipes/<ver>/reloc_*.yml are now COMMITTED.
# They're regenerated from tools/codegen/reloc_data_symbols.<ver>.txt +
# ROM by tools/codegen/generate_yamls.py; regen and re-commit when
# reloc_data_symbols.<ver>.txt changes (rare for a frozen v1.0). Same
# pattern as src/resources/RelocFileTable.<ver>.cpp.
# Their content (file_id ↔ symbol ↔ ROM offset/size) is a strict
# subset of upstream ssb-decomp-re's smashbrothers.<ver>.yaml splat
# config — standard decomp metadata, no ROM bytes.

